        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: LNW-80, Expert\n- Companies: LNW Research, Gradiente Eletrônica\n- Topics: MSX home computers, Brazilian market\n\nFacts:\n- The LNW-80 was released in 1982.\n- The LNW-80 was the first computer built by LNW Research.\n- In the mid-1980s, Gradiente Eletrônica launched the Expert in the Brazilian market.\n- The Expert was the second and last MSX home computer launched in the Brazilian market.\n- Gradiente Eletrônica was best known for game consoles and Hi-Fi equipment.",
